            "review_text": "binluo\nBinh Duong Province, Vietnam13 contributions\n0\nDelicious pizza, elegant environment, with a tropical rainforest in the middle\nOct 2023 • Business\n🌺🌺🌺🔵Environment🔵🌺🌺🌺\n🌺🌺🌺🔵Nice🔵🌺🌺🌺\n🌺🌺🌺🔵, food🔵🌺🌺🌺\n🌺🌺🌺🔵Good🔵🌺🌺🌺\n🌺🌺🌺🔵Eat🔵🌺🌺🌺\nShow original\nWritten October 23, 2023\nPizza 4P's Guest Service\nDear Mr/Ms. binluo,\n\nThank you for taking the time to provide Pizza 4P's Hikari Binh Duong with a review of your experience. \nWe are pleased to hear that our team made your experience pleasant and we look forward to seeing you again soon!\nTeam Pizza 4P's\nRead more\nWritten October 24, 2023\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
