            "review_text": "AugereauBui\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam82 contributions\n0\nA Fushion Resutaurant of Italy x Japan\nJan 2023\nAlmost all the foods are nice, especially the pizza with me. I was disappointed with its bolognese spaghetti. The place better than any 4P's Pizza in Ho Chi Minh City. This is a new restaurant also in was built in a sustainable sculpture with many green around and that make your time in here never wasted. Moreover, thumb up for the staffs and half half pizza option which you can try two different taste in 1 pizza. Overall, it is was good and I satisfied with the price for this meal\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten March 17, 2023\nPizza 4P's Guest Service\nHello Mr/Ms. Augereau_18,\n\nThank you very much for your feedback at Pizza 4P's Hikari Binh Duong.\n\nWe really appreciated and are interested in the experience you have had at our restaurant.\nYour compliments and affection for the staff, space and food of the restaurant is a great motivation for Pizza 4P's to continue to try harder, to bring customers the best quality of service.\nAlthough we are sorry to hear that you were not really satisfied with the Bolognese Spaghetti at Pizza 4P's, and that the pizza did not meet your expectations. \nWith the goal of always providing guests with \"Wow\" experiences, we hope you can come back to Pizza 4P's next time to experience other great dishes.\n\nWe are really thankful for your reviews, wish you a nice day. 🤗💙\nTeam Pizza 4P's\nRead more\nWritten March 18, 2023\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
